~Version ---------------------------------------------------
VERS.   2.0 : CWLS log ASCII Standard -VERSION 2.0
WRAP.    NO : One line per depth step
DLM . SPACE : Column Data Section Delimiter
~Well ------------------------------------------------------
STRT.M            2000.00000 : Start Depth
STOP.M            2150.00000 : Stop Depth
STEP.M               0.10000 : Step Depth
NULL.                -999.25 : Null Value
COMP.                        : COMPANY
WELL.     WELLSCOPE-SYNTH-01 : Synthetic Test Well
FLD .    NORTH SEA SYNTHETIC : Field Name
LOC .             BLOCK 16/1 : Location
PROV.                        : PROVINCE
CNTY.                        : COUNTY
STAT.                        : STATE
CTRY.                        : COUNTRY
SRVC. WELLSCOPE PETROPHYSICS : Service Company
DATE.             2026-10-21 : Log Date
UWI .                        : UNIQUE WELL ID
API .                        : API NUMBER
~Curve Information -----------------------------------------
DEPTH.M     : Measured Depth
GR   .GAPI  : Gamma Ray Log
RHOB .G/C3  : Bulk Density
NPHI .V/V   : Neutron Porosity (Limestone Matrix)
DT   .US/F  : Compressional Sonic Slowness
RT   .OHMM  : Deep True Resistivity
RXO  .OHMM  : Shallow Flushed Zone Resistivity
CALI .IN    : Borehole Caliper
SP   .MV    : Spontaneous Potential
DRHO .G/C3  : Density Correction
~Params ----------------------------------------------------
BS .IN    8.5 : Bit Size
RMF.OHMM 0.85 : Mud Filtrate Resistivity
BHT.DEGC 85.0 : Bottom Hole Temperature
